---
const rows=[
{code:'01',title:'Research & Development',body:'Independent experiments in useful intelligence, learning systems, and constrained computation.',href:'/services#research'},
{code:'02',title:'Technical Systems',body:'IT practice, operational documentation, infrastructure research, and tools made for real environments.',href:'/services#systems'},
{code:'03',title:'Publications & Other Work',body:'Essays, technical publications, creative projects, and a continuing catalogue of independent work.',href:'/services#publications'}
];
---
<section class="divisions-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">02</span><h2>Operating divisions</h2></div>
    <h2 class="report-section-title">Activities across disciplines</h2>
    <p class="report-lede">The organization maintains a deliberately broad remit. Each division exists to house meaningful work—not to place a limit on it.</p>
    <div class="division-table">
      {rows.map(row => <a class="division-row" href={row.href}><span class="division-code">{row.code}</span><h3 class="division-name">{row.title}</h3><p class="division-description">{row.body}</p><span class="division-action" aria-hidden="true">DETAILS ↗</span></a>)}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>